Description: Portable Apps Store
 # AppGallery
 GUI frontend for AM made with GTK4.
 .
 > [!IMPORTANT]
 > AppGallery has not gone through thorough testing. Bug reports would be
 appreciated!
 .
 ## Building
 ### Prerequisites
 - **Rust**:
 .
 On Debian based distros:
 ```bash
 sudo apt install rustup
 rustup default stable
 ```
 On Arch based distros:
 ```bash
 sudo pacman -S rustup
 rustup default stable
 ```
 - **AM**:
 .
 See instructions at: https://github.com/ivan-hc/AM#installation
 .
 - and the **source code** of this project of course
 .
 ### Compiling
 ```bash
 cd appgallery
 ```
 .
 Directly run:
 ```bash
 cargo run --bin appgallery # this will create and run a debug binary
 ```
 ```bash
 cargo run --bin appgallery --release # this will create an optimized release
 binary (takes longer to compile)
 ```
 OR install to `~/.cargo/bin`
 ```bash
 cargo install --path . # this is also a release build
 ```
 .
